Publisher model/tokenizer assets are explicitly downloaded to ignored
developer directories and independently hash-verified; their model cards
declare Apache-2.0. User-selected GGUF carries its own tokenizer/vocabulary,
never embedded in the APK. Official and older community token layouts
are distinct and must not share fixed speech offsets or generic EOS IDs.
Full graph/tensor presence and host semantic generation do not establish
complete Android TTS, reference fidelity, intelligibility or voice quality.
No real-person reference audio or model examples are bundled.
